/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The key objective of the IIIT Tiruchirappalli is to foster student interaction with leading industry and research to address current and future IT challenges. It aims to offer an industry-relevant, practical curriculum that develops future leaders capable of excelling in complex environments. Though the student intake is limited, the institute strives to produce high-impact, world-class IT professionals.)
/E (The key objective of the IIIT Tiruchirappalli is to foster student interaction with leading industry and research to address current and future IT challenges. It aims to offer an industry-relevant, practical curriculum that develops future leaders capable of excelling in complex environments. Though the student intake is limited, the institute strives to produce high-impact, world-class IT professionals.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
