369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Indian Institute of Information Technology Tiruchirappalli \(IIITT\), established under the Public-Private Partnership \(PPP\) model, admits meritorious students through national-level entrance exams, creating a diverse academic environment. It follows a progressive curriculum with strong technical foundations in the first two years, followed by industry-integrated learning and specialization. IIITT also focuses on holistic development through soft skills training, internships, live projects, hackathons, and mentorship programs to ensure graduates are industry-ready.)
/E (The Indian Institute of Information Technology Tiruchirappalli \(IIITT\), established under the Public-Private Partnership \(PPP\) model, admits meritorious students through national-level entrance exams, creating a diverse academic environment. It follows a progressive curriculum with strong technical foundations in the first two years, followed by industry-integrated learning and specialization. IIITT also focuses on holistic development through soft skills training, internships, live projects, hackathons, and mentorship programs to ensure graduates are industry-ready.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
