/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The B.Tech. and M.Tech. programmes at IIIT Tiruchirappalli are meticulously designed to blend theoretical foundations with practical applications. With a strong emphasis on emerging technologies, research-driven learning, and real-world industry exposure, the curriculum is structured to equip students with both technical expertise and problem-solving skills. Core courses, electives, lab work, internships, and project-based learning ensure that graduates are not only academically proficient but also industry-ready professionals capable of addressing complex technological challenges.)
